cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pRCC-RNA-Seq, please cite the software using the metadata in this file."
title: "pRCC-RNA-Seq"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An assay-aware Snakemake workflow for reproducible bulk RNA-seq processing
  and gene-expression quantification, developed for harmonized multi-site
  processing in the pRCC-TREAT consortium and also usable outside the
  consortium.
